//! rilua equivalents of admin_api.rs, admin_api_world.rs,
//! admin_api_mail_premade.rs, admin_combat.rs, and admin_encounter.rs.
//!
//! Registers the `A_Admin` namespace as RustFn closures on rilua's VM.
//! Each function accesses SimState via `borrow_state` / `borrow_state_mut`
//! from `methods`, using `FromStack` for argument extraction.
//!
//! # generated_stubs.rs approach
//!
//! generated_stubs.rs contains ~962 auto-generated stub functions.
//! These will be regenerated by tools/generate_stubs.py with rilua output
//! rather than converted by hand. See the script for the template.

